   Tasks Shown: All
   ->  Task
         Node: host=localhost port=58070 dbname=regression
         ->  Delete on documents_95241_95240011 d
               CTE s
                 ->  Limit
                       ->  LockRows
                             ->  Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiExplainQueryScan)
                                   indexName: _id_
                                   ->  Index Scan using _id_ on documents_95241_95240011 documents_95241
                                         Index Cond: ((shard_key_value = '4322365043291501017'::bigint) AND (object_id OPERATOR(documentdb_core.=) '{ "" : { "$numberInt" : "1" } }'::documentdb_core.bson))
                                         Filter: ((document OPERATOR(documentdb_api_catalog.@=) '{ "_id" : { "$numberInt" : "1" }, "collation" : "en-u-ks-level1" }'::documentdb_core.bson) AND (document OPERATOR(documentdb_api_catalog.@=) '{ "a" : "APPLE", "collation" : "en-u-ks-level1" }'::documentdb_core.bson))
               ->  Nested Loop
                     Join Filter: (d.ctid = s.ctid)
                     ->  Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiExplainQueryScan)
